Operator decision (relayed): index the 51 memory files that have no line,
and keep _DEMOTE_ORDER as proposed. adopt() builds `- [Title](file) — hook`
from the file's name: and description:, appends it to _index_<group>.md,
and refuses an already-indexed name, an index file, or a missing file.
The tier-2 placement is factored out of demote() into _place_in_tier2()
and shared. _DEMOTE_ORDER is now marked operator-confirmed in code and
spec. 74 tests pass. The live adoption and its numbers follow in the next
commit's record.

Staging note: the paths were staged before a3804b477a1-era commit by another
agent; its pre-commit stash/restore left them unstaged (the working tree
kept every byte). Re-staged by explicit path and committed.

